<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3284] z.getInterpreterContext().out().clear() broken in Python interpreter</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3284</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Zeppelin 0.7.x, %spark and %python interpreter able to clear output&#160;using z.getInterpreterContext().out().clear()&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12912843/12912843_image-2018-03-02-15-54-38-942.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, master branch and branch-0.8, PythonInterpreter does not provide the same capability.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
